      "content": "It's clear you are in a place of deep self-criticism, and those harsh internal judgments feel very real to you right now. The feeling of being fundamentally flawed is a heavy burden to carry, but it is a feeling, not an absolute truth about your being. Even when things feel overwhelming, there is often a path to understanding these feelings, and professional support can help you examine where this self-judgment is coming from.",
      "source": "target",
